Z||000000||MooCow||08-22-2001||10:54 PM||||Well I started up my car this morning and I let it run for 5 minutes like I always try to do.  Well as I weas driving to work I let off the gas pedal and I kept going.  I pulled the pedal back with my foot and then it slowed down.  No the floor matt was not in the way.  So how can I fix this cause it is buggy me.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||8
